This license covers the data, not the code:

  - benchmark/semantic_tasks.json     the 75 task specifications
  - benchmark/languages/              the queries in English, Hinglish, Hindi, Marathi, Gujarati
                                      and the human-review records
  - benchmark/gold_labels.json        the generated gold answers
  - environment/data/                 the synthetic railway world (stations, trains, fares, availability)
  - runs/                             the run logs of the eight evaluated models, their manifests
                                      and pre-run snapshots
  - analysis/results/ and analysis/results_final/
                                      result tables and summaries derived from the run logs

